SUMMARY:THE DEBUT
LOCATION:UW Cinematheque\, 4070 Vilas Hall\, 821 University Ave\, Madison\
 , WI 53706
DESCRIPTION:USA | 2026 | DCP | 105 min.\n\nDirector: Jesse Eisenberg\n\nCa
 st: Julianne Moore\, Jesse Eisenberg\, Paul Giamatti\n\nWhen Mona Friedma
 n is cast in a bit part at a small community theater\, she transforms fro
 m a shy\, unassuming housewife into a zealous method actor willing to do 
 anything to protect the artistic integrity of her marginal role—even if
  it means waging war against the show’s domineering director. (A24 publ
 icity)\n\nhttps://cinema.wisc.edu/events/the-debut/\n\nSource: UW Cinemat
 heque
URL:https://cinema.wisc.edu/events/the-debut/
END:VEVENT
