 agazine to interview the up-and-coming band Stillwater \, William embarks
  on an eye-opening journey with the band's tour\, despite the objections 
 of his protective mother. -Rotten Tomatoes"\n \n"Oh\, what a lovely film
 . I was almost hugging myself while I watched it."\n-Roger Ebert of the C
 hicago Sun-Times\n \nWatch the trailer here:  https://www.youtube.com/w
