SUMMARY:BUDDY – Casper Kelly in Person!
LOCATION:UW Cinematheque\, 4070 Vilas Hall\, 821 University Ave\, Madison\
 , WI 53706
DESCRIPTION:USA | 2026 | DCP | 95 min.\n\nDirector: Casper Kelly\n\nCast: 
 Delaney Quinn\, Cristin Milioti\, Topher Grace\n\nIn the first theatrical
 ly released feature from the inventive mind of writer/director Casper Kel
 ly\, a brave girl and her friends must escape a kids television show. A w
 ild\, unpredictable\, sometimes blood-soaked horror comedy\, Buddy featur
 es stellar work from the cast\, especially young lead Delaney Quinn\, and
  guest appearances from Patton Oswalt\, Michael Shannon\, and Keegan-Mich
 ael Key as the title character. Casper Kelly will join us in person for a
  post-screening discussion!\n\nhttps://cinema.wisc.edu/events/buddy/\n\nS
 ource: UW Cinematheque
URL:https://cinema.wisc.edu/events/buddy/
END:VEVENT
