SUMMARY:ADULT SWIM YULE LOG – Casper Kelly in Person!
LOCATION:UW Cinematheque\, 4070 Vilas Hall\, 821 University Ave\, Madison\
 , WI 53706
DESCRIPTION:USA | 2022 | DCP | 91 min.\n\nDirector: Casper Kelly\n\nCast: 
 Andrea Laing\, Justin Miles\, Jessica Fontaine\n\nA cozy two-minute yule 
 log video morphs into a disturbing home invasion horror movie that become
 s a supernatural cabin-in-the-woods thriller with a young couple who may 
 be at the mercy of a haunted fireplace! Originally presented on Adult Swi
 m without any announcement or warning\, this wild holiday slay ride found
  immediate appreciation from horror-comedy fans and spawned an equally fu
 n sequel. Yule Log will be preceded by Casper Kelly’s celebrated\, hila
 rious Adult Swim short\, Too Many Cooks (2014\, 11 min.). Casper Kelly wi
 ll join us in person for a post-screening discussion.\n\nhttps://cinema.w
 isc.edu/events/adult-swim-yule-log/\n\nSource: UW Cinematheque
URL:https://cinema.wisc.edu/events/adult-swim-yule-log/
END:VEVENT
